        <text>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 48pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Bradley Hand ITC&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-cursor&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Thank you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 72pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Bradley Hand ITC&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We sincerely appreciate you taking the time to share your thoughts and experiences with us. Your input is invaluable and will help us improve the Fonteva Event system and future events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;What’s Next?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We will carefully review your responses and use them to enhance our system for future events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;If you have any additional comments or suggestions, feel free to reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Mahi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;-myewedalsew@iafc.org.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
